  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "http2: Add TLS_RENEG_PERMITTED setting support",
  "description": "This PR introduces support for the HTTP/2 setting TLS_RENEG_PERMITTED, listed by IANA and used by Microsoft products. A sample output looks like this (tested against an Azure SQL server in the wild):\n\n```\nSettings - TLS Renegotiation Permitted : 2\n    Settings Identifier: TLS Renegotiation Permitted (16)\n    TLS Renegotiation Permitted: Server-initiated acceptable (2)\n```\n\nResources: https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/mt221726.aspx https://www.iana.org/assignments/http2-parameters/http2-parameters.xhtml#settings",
  "state": "merged",
