      "title": "http2: Add TLS_RENEG_PERMITTED setting support",
      "message": "http2: Add TLS_RENEG_PERMITTED setting support\n\nImplements proper display formatting for the TLS_RENEG_PERMITTED setting\n(MS-HTTP2E extension). The setting value uses bits 30-31 to indicate\nsupport for server-initiated and client-initiated TLS renegotiation.\n",
      "author_name": "Sébastien Féry",
      "author_email": "27950536-kriztalz@users.noreply.gitlab.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-10-01T12:22:58.000+02:00",
